{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a3c022ad3d922c872873f751b4927dad3001b556178b9f8335cf7f48cbc9241e", "ja": "うん、サマになってる。さすがだな。", "zh": "嗯，挺有模有样的。真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "f029fbb961ca6db5a48d65ddfe2264b9f5f0692c0de0fb29e79e4961ec809ba6", "ja": "まだまだ！　油断はしないよ。\n後半戦で逆転KO、なんてことにならないようにね。", "zh": "还早着呢！我可不会大意。\n免得在后半战被人逆转KO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1007_p", "source_sha256": "800e45a42b010f4b2f8ec56954d9d3c2ccaad967ea7ce5f44cd905dd6c6d4b59", "ja": "いい心構えだな！　頼もしいよ。", "zh": "这个心态很好！真是可靠啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "b650a0a186f98065235bca7c745ac07ff692704e197c9366737915685f9b866b", "ja": "へへっ♪　アタシ、この衣装に一目ぼれしちゃってさ。\n今日のために、色々準備してきたの！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我对这套服装一见钟情，所以呀……为了今天，我可是做了各种准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "c7e56d238a839a6dcd669a003588a9b323da9f565a3593fdb427af078e524ecf", "ja": "だから、まだまだいっぱい、カッコいいポーズを\n考えてあるんだよね！　へへっ、後半も期待しててよ♪", "zh": "所以，我还想了好多帅气的姿势呢！  \n嘿嘿，后半场也要期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4c2584b67a722b02f07bb21b1e704a6ab13843cd5fe81636fdf777b56e6c65ad", "ja": "えっ、そうだったのか？\nだとしたら、のり子に悪い事をしたかも……。", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗？\n这么说来，我可能做了对不起典子的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "02f745f73e10c5e8628f7dc8c16573cf38bef81ea96d1d77899c4a266fbd5930", "ja": "えっ？　なになに、なんで？", "zh": "咦？什么什么，为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58c4d46ceff3e432dd0ffbf78655780f0f8db653dcacbbda438c6c7d8230a56b", "ja": "実は……カメラマンさんから、後半はセクシーな\n感じも入れてみましょうって提案されたんだ。", "zh": "其实……摄影师提议说，\n后半段试着加入一些性感的风格看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e7a7cd14873a628482db041f0f09c06ee71508024cac055de6d48f505cedba6", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、それでなんて答えたの？", "zh": "咦！？那、那你是怎么回答的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1014_p", "source_sha256": "126fb0e6c7b48aa0e3a3f775543f499ea7ee27c0923cbd6b4feef8b4751bf5b7", "ja": "俺ものり子の、そういう写真が見てみたかったから、\nお願いします！って答えちゃった……。", "zh": "因为我也想看看诺莉子的那种照片，就回答了“拜托了！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "c886bf0f29400dc97829031bef9ba6793b06f7602504cbafb0960dd04c7c93f1", "ja": "え、ええ～っ！　期待してくれるのは嬉しいけど……。\nアタシのこの気合いはどこに向けたらいいのー！", "zh": "诶、诶诶～！你对我抱有期待，我是很高兴啦……可是，我这股干劲到底该往哪儿使啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8694ba957e5490667a93d0c2ff4cdf3669245d40d154592e8be7a3845f25e733", "ja": "すまん！　でものり子なら、\nカッコいいセクシーも表現できると思うんだ！", "zh": "抱歉！不过，如果是诺莉子，\n我觉得你一定也能表现出帅气又性感的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ae8e886aa5c755cc750afa63bbe0520c164d368d9d1c665062e39d265f5b4faf", "ja": "スポーツ選手の持つ、セクシーな感じというか……。\nなんかそういう感じの、のり子ならわかるだろ？", "zh": "就是运动员身上那种性感的感觉……该怎么说呢。  \n总之就是那种感觉，纪子你应该明白吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "db999c15d496f117c29a3408f9c2461ed9f33d5c25bd2c2f23cef15bc865bb0c", "ja": "あ、そっか。プロレスラーもカッコいいけど、\nセクシーだなって思う時もあるもんね！", "zh": "啊，这么说来也是。职业摔跤手虽然很帅气，但有时候也会让人觉得很性感呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc04049e1aaad73b7246515033d8c1d78e3a9b4d6de93fd539710d148cab622b", "ja": "了解♪　それじゃあ、後半は、\nアタシなりのセクシー、見せてくるよ！", "zh": "了解♪ 那么，后半场就来展现一下属于我的性感吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0213_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "0ea70edd1f719938c39a9bd851db7f0e378b65c067af7b988d457af1944e871c", "ja": "アチョーっ！　……じゃないや。\nアチョー……あれ？　アチョ～……？", "zh": "呀——！……不对。\n呀——……咦？呀～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
